<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Brainstorming & Ideation</title>
<style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#f4f7fb;color:#1f2a37}.page{max-width:820px;margin:28px auto;background:#fff;padding:48px 54px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.banner{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1d4f73);color:#fff;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:12px}.banner h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}.meta{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#edf7ff}.section h2{color:#1d4f73;border-bottom:2px solid #dfeaf2;padding-bottom:6px;margin-top:18px}.ul{margin:10px 0 0 18px;line-height:1.8;font-size:14px}li{margin-bottom:6px}</style></head>
<body><div class="page"><div class="banner"><h1>LegalEase — AI-Powered Legal Document Generator</h1><div class="meta">Team Leader: Koushik S<br>Team Members: Koushik S, Dhanush S, Harry Rithik P, Pritam Debnath, Sargunanithi S<br>Team ID: SWTID-XXXX-8781</div></div><div class="section"><h2>Brainstorming & Ideation</h2><ul class="ul"><li>The project was designed to reduce repetitive legal drafting by combining AI guidance with a user-friendly document workflow.</li><li>The team identified a practical need for faster drafting of common legal agreements, especially where time and consistency are critical.</li><li>The final concept centered on a system that accepts basic inputs, generates a structured legal draft, and supports review and export.</li><li>The solution was intended to be clear enough for everyday use while still robust for academic project evaluation.</li></ul></div></div></body></html>
